Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 15:56:21 +0330
Subject: [PATCH 166/230] feat(stats): add /api/matches/:id/team-stats route +
 wire possession/corners/pass-accuracy into comparison view
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- GET /api/matches/:id/team-stats serves both sides from match_team_stats
  (percentages rounded, goals off the matches row), answers { home: null,
  away: null } when the box score has not synced, and 404s for
  non-allowlist leagues like every other match-detail endpoint.
- api client: TeamStats type + getMatchTeamStats.
- StatsTab: synced box score builds all 8 comparison rows (possession,
  shots, on target, corners, fouls, offsides, pass accuracy, saves);
  player aggregates remain the fallback only; player tables unchanged.
- tests/teamStats.test.ts: driven over real HTTP in a child process —
  synced shape, unsynced nulls, allowlist 404.

